# Forgetful Doodle 2.0 — environment variables

# Claude API key for AI deck generation (Claude Sonnet 5), used server-side only
# by the /api/generate proxy. Without it, AI deck-making is disabled and you can
# still hand-build decks; the app runs fine locally without a key.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=

# Vercel Postgres connection string. Set automatically when you link a Vercel
# Postgres store to the project. Without it, best scores / streak / decks fall
# back to browser localStorage (per-device). Provide one for cross-device sync.
POSTGRES_URL=

# Passcode for the apps. When set, every page and every /api route requires it;
# it is entered once per device and kept in a signed, httpOnly cookie for a
# year. When unset, everything is open to anyone with the URL, which is how the
# app behaved before the gate existed. Set it in production.
#
# Changing it signs everyone out, because the cookie is signed with a key
# derived from it. Make it long: a failed attempt costs CPU by design, but that
# raises the cost of guessing rather than removing it.
DOODLE_PASSCODE

# Which profile the apps read and write. Optional, defaults to "elena". This is
# a partition key, not a credential.
DOODLE_USER_ID
